      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Well it probably does what it says. Just so quick that you do not notice it. So it will teleport you to the first Transform, but immediately to the next one and so on, until you end up at the last one. It doesn't make much sense, but it works correctly. It should however be changed to be limited to only one object yes.",
