  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-18T00:15:21.313Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The document of TeleportPlayer https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/teleportplayer describes about receivers as following: \"Gameobject(s) the player should be teleported to\". But current version 2018.4.1p3 client seems to use last receiver always.\n\nAlso, explanation of action is \"Teleports player to the set location(s)\". But current implementation does not have ability to set multiple locations.\n\nI think documentation and implementation are mismatched. So please clarify the specification and write it to documentation.\n\nAbstract in Japanese: TeleportPlayer のドキュメントは複数のレシーバーへのテレポートが行われうるように読める。だが、実態としては常に最後のレシーバーが使われているようだ。ドキュメントと実装がずれているようなのでレシーバーが複数の場合の仕様を明らかにしてほしい。",
  "error": null,
